offee]]\n* ¼ cup white granulated [[Cookbook:Sugar|sugar]]\n* ½ stick [[Cookbook:Cinnamon|cinnamon]]\n* ½ cup [[Cookbook:Heavy Cream|heavy cream]]\n* 2 [[Cookbook:Tablespoon|tbsp]] [[Cookbook:Coffee Liqueur|coffee liqueur]]\n* 1 [[Cookbook:Pinch|pinch]] [[Cookbook:Salt|salt]]\n* 2 tbsp [[Cookbook:Butter|butter]]\n\n== Procedure ==\n#Combine all ingredients except bananas in a large [[Cookbook:Saucepan|saucepan]]. Bring to a [[Cookbook:Boiling|boil]] over medium high heat until reduced to ½ cup. Remove from heat and set aside.\n#Brush bananas liberally with coffee mixture. [[Cookbook:Grilling|Grill]] over medium high heat just until marked and slightly charred.\n#Remove from heat, peel, and drizzle several more spoonfuls of syrup over bananas. Serve with remaining syrup on the side.\n\n[[Category:Recipes using banana]]\n[[Category:Recipes using brewed coffee]]\n[[Category:Recipes for dessert]]\n[[Category:Grilled recipes]]\n[[Category:Recipes for sauces and condiments]]\n[[Category:Recipes using butter]]\n[[Category:Recipes using white sugar]]\n[[Category:Recipes using cinnamon stick]]\n[[Category:Recipes using coffee liqueur]]\n[[Category:Recipes using heavy cream]]","isRecipe":true,"recipe":{"name":"Grilled Bananas with Coffee Syrup","nameAr":null,"servings":null,"servingsSourceText":null,"ingredients":[{"id":"source-line-1","name":"6 bananas, halved but unpeeled","sourceText":"6 bananas, halved but unpeeled","amountText":"6 bananas, halved but unpeeled","amount":null,"unit":null,"foodBinding":null},{"id":"source-line-2","name":"1 cup weak brewed coffee","sourceText":"1 cup weak brewed coffee","amountText":"1 cup weak brewed coffee","amount":null,"unit":null,"foodBinding":null},{"id":"source-line-3","name":"¼ cup white granulated sugar","sourceText":"¼ cup white granulated sugar","amountText":"¼ cup white granulated sugar","amount":null,"unit":null,"foodBinding":null},{"id":"source-line-4","name":"½ stick cinnamon","sourceText":"½ stick cinnamon","amountText":"½ st